WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
Two bottles of juice sit on a table.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.890
One label says zero
point seven litres.

3
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.230
The other says zero
point six five litres.

4
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.750
The second number has more digits.

5
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.830
It even has sixty-five in it,

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.870
and sixty-five is much
bigger than seven.

7
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.130
So does the second
bottle hold more juice?

8
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.290
In this mission, you'll find
out what each digit is worth,

9
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.230
and put numbers in order.

10
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.510
You'll split numbers into primes.

11
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.290
And you'll find the highest
common factor and lowest common

12
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.510
multiple of two numbers.

13
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:37.370
Your mission: decide which
bottle holds more juice.
